Mod Kepp Hock

A bright and vibrant visual preset for Grand Theft Auto V Enhanced.

Mod Kepp Hock is a community-made ReShade preset focused on richer colors, balanced contrast and a brighter visual atmosphere.

Features

- Bright and vibrant color palette
- Enhanced color saturation
- Balanced contrast
- Warm visual atmosphere
- Custom ReShade configuration

Compatibility

Component| Target
Game| GTA V Enhanced
Platform| Windows 10 / 11
Graphics API| DirectX 12
Mode| Story Mode
Version| 1.0

Project Structure

- "config/" — project settings
- "reshade/" — ReShade preset
- "docs/" — installation guide and changelog
- "screenshots/" — before and after screenshots

Installation

Read the "Installation Guide" (docs/INSTALL.md).

Screenshots

Screenshots will be added after testing the preset in Story Mode.

